      "comment": "BELLA'S STAR (1) was unwanted in betting but burnt to an early lead and scored an all the way win over 400m at this track in Maiden, scoring by 1.75 lengths (22.81). Brilliant beginner who should be leading the way here. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. MAKO MAX (7) stalked lead from an outside box last start before finishing second (22.94) at this track in a Maiden over 400m. Expected to feature. CONFLICTED (4) had been racing in honest fashion recording three placings in a row before finishing fourth (30.54) at Sandown latest. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Has ability and is one of the better chances. RUXLEY (8) is likely to have admirers.",
